      <title>No Kings turns its focus to voting this weekend. Here's what we know</title>
      <author>Ava Berger</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/17/nx-s1-6004887/no-kings-voting-trump</link>
      <comments>https://text.npr.org/2026/10/17/nx-s1-6004887/no-kings-voting-trump</comments>
