jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6000x4002+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2F5a%2F0741dcc7482abf55d672fd3e7dd2%2Fthomas-2026-hi-res-download-2.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6000x4002+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2F5a%2F0741dcc7482abf55d672fd3e7dd2%2Fthomas-2026-hi-res-download-2.jpg 1800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6000x4002+0+0/resize/2400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2F5a%2F0741dcc7482abf55d672fd3e7dd2%2Fthomas-2026-hi-res-download-2.jpg 2400w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6000x4002+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2F5a%2F0741dcc7482abf55d672fd3e7dd2%2Fthomas-2026-hi-res-download-2.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1350px) 953px, (min-width: 1025px) calc(100vw - 395px), (min-width: 768px) calc(100vw - 60px), calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6000x4002+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2F5a%2F0741dcc7482abf55d672fd3e7dd2%2Fthomas-2026-hi-res-download-2.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/6000x4002+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2F5a%2F0741dcc7482abf55d672fd3e7dd2%2Fthomas-2026-hi-res-download-2.jpg" class="img" alt="Chip Thomas, a retired physician on the Navajo Reservation, is well known for his large photograhpic murals. Now, he&amp;#039;s been recognized with a MacArthur &amp;quot;genius&amp;quot; grant." fetchpriority="high" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Chip Thomas, a retired physician on the Navajo Reservation, is well known for his large photographic murals. Now, he's been recognized with a MacArthur "genius" grant.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          John D. and Catherine T. MacArthur Foundation                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;When we think of street art, urban alleyways and subway cars tagged with spray paint come to mind.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;But for nearly two decades, Chip Thomas has been putting up public art installations in rural places across the Navajo Nation. In September, &lt;a href="https://www.macfound.org/fellows/class-of-2026/chip-thomas" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;u&gt;the MacArthur Foundation awarded Thomas one of its "genius" awards&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; for the social impact of his artwork.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resnx-s1-5779751-100" class="bucketwrap internallink insettwocolumn inset2col"&gt;                     &lt;!-- END CLASS="BUCKET IMG" --&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;     &lt;!-- END ID="RESNX-S1-5779751-100" CLASS="BUCKETWRAP INTERNALLINK INSETTWOCOLUMN INSET2COL " --&gt;    &lt;p&gt;His public art features outsized black and white images depicting daily life on the rez: men on horseback, grandmothers herding sheep, the delighted faces of children playing.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;His materials are paper, black and white ink, and adhesive, and his canvas might be any building within view of the highway, from deserted gas stations, to old trailers, to water tanks.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;"Structures that are close enough to the road, that are big enough, where I can put an interesting, hopefully engaging piece," Thomas said, "that will draw some attention, but not too much, because I don't want to cause any accidents."&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;Against the array of earth tones, scenic mesas and curious sandstone forms, each installation materializes like a spectral window into another dimension. Some travelers are so surprised, and overcome, that they turn around to come back for a closer look.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-148255" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4000;         --source-height: 2667;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x2667+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F8f%2F2b%2F24b59aed4e81a0a7b9629a51f168%2Fimg-3576.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x2667+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F8f%2F2b%2F24b59aed4e81a0a7b9629a51f168%2Fimg-3576.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x2667+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F8f%2F2b%2F24b59aed4e81a0a7b9629a51f168%2Fimg-3576.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x2667+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F8f%2F2b%2F24b59aed4e81a0a7b9629a51f168%2Fimg-3576.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x