 Arizona." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Thomas' 2026 installation at an abandoned gas station in Gray Mountain, Az. The painted handprints smeared on the subjects' faces symbolize of the high rates of domestic violence and murder among Native American women.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          &lt;a   href="https://jetsonorama.net/" class="Link"  target="_blank"   &gt;jetsonorama&lt;/a&gt;                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;div id="resg-s1-148256" class="bucketwrap image x-large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4000;         --source-height: 2667;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x2667+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F32%2Fbc%2Fbfd2cec64a52a1f8ce3479d71179%2Fsam.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4000x2667+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F32%2Fbc%2Fbfd2cec64a52a1f8ce3479d71179%2Fsam.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop